body.p:
1.  The Commission shall be assisted by the Advisory Committee for Public Contracts set up by Article 1 of Decision 71/306/EEC (
            25
         ) (hereinafter referred to as ‘the Committee’).

In conformity with Council Directive 89/665/EEC of 21 December 1989 on the coordination of the laws, regulations and administrative provisions relating to the application of review procedures to the award of public supply and public works contracts (
            26
         ), Member States shall ensure implementation of this Directive by effective, available and transparent mechanisms.

